<title>USA: Calgon Carbon sees Q3 shr $0.10-$0.12.</title>
<headline>Calgon Carbon sees Q3 shr $0.10-$0.12.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calgon Carbon Corp said on Thursday it anticipates its third quarter earnings will be in the range of $0.10 to $0.12 per share, below Wall Street consensus estimates.</p>
</text>
